{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/873","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/873/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/873/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/873/events","html_url":"https://github.com/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/873","id":5808011372,"node_id":"I_kwDORhCjFc8AAAABWi84bA","number":873,"title":"UNMAPPED_0385 'FeSO43 x n H2O' competes for the Fe2(SO4)3 x n H2O label; the #863 ledger row relies on row order","user":{"login":"realmarcin","id":4625870,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MjU4NzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4625870?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin","html_url":"https://github.com/realmarcin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10370025893,"node_id":"LA_kwDORhCjFc8AAAACahoJpQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"d73a4a","default":true,"description":"Something isn't working","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-10-12T03:39:39Z","updated_at":"2026-11-08T07:49:00Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Found reviewing #863.\n\n`docs/data/label_index.csv` has two `resolved:owned` rows for the label `Fe2(SO4)3 x n H2O`:\n- the preferred term of `kgmicrobe.compound:fe2_so43_x_n_h2o` (MAPPED);\n- a `RAW_TEXT` synonym of `UNMAPPED_0385` (`data/ingredients/unmapped/FeSO43_X_N_H2O.yaml`, preferred term `FeSO43 x n H2O`, 0 occurrences).\n\nclaw's builder keeps the first row, so the label anchors to the mapped record, and #863's rejection-ledger row for CHEBI:53438 applies. If the row order changes, the label would anchor to UNMAPPED_0385, the ledger row would no longer match it, and the anhydrous recipe id could come back through the fallback.\n\nUNMAPPED_0385's own deep-research notes describe the same iron(III) sulfate hydrate. It looks like a duplicate of the mapped record, a merge candidate under the merge-ingredients procedure. At minimum, its `Fe2(SO4)3 x n H2O` synonym should not compete for the mapped record's preferred term.\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/873/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/873/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}